(1. Purpose) Tj
0 -15 Td
(This procedure governs artwork and concept approval for licensed) Tj
0 -15 Td
(properties. No purchase order for a licensed SKU may be released) Tj
0 -15 Td
(until licensor sign-off has been recorded.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(2. Scope) Tj
0 -15 Td
(All new licensed programs, seasonal extensions and reorder SKUs) Tj
0 -15 Td
(with artwork changes. Applies to Design, Licensing, Merchandising) Tj
0 -15 Td
(and Product Development.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(3. Roles) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- Design Lead: prepares the concept package and artwork files.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- Licensing Manager: reviews packages, submits to the licensor,) Tj
0 -15 Td
(  records sign-off in the Artwork Log.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- Buyer: creates purchase orders after sign-off is recorded.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(- QA: verifies artwork against the licensor style guide on request.) Tj
