(4. Procedure) Tj
0 -15 Td
(4.1 Design submits the concept package \(concept form, artwork) Tj
0 -15 Td
(    PDFs, SKU list\) to the Licensing queue.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(4.2 The Licensing Manager reviews the package for compliance with) Tj
0 -15 Td
(    the licensor style guide within 2 business days.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(4.3 The Licensing Manager submits the package to the licensor for) Tj
0 -15 Td
(    sign-off through the Licensing Portal.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(4.4 On licensor approval the Licensing Manager records the sign-off) Tj
0 -15 Td
(    in the Artwork Log \(column "Licensor sign-off date"\).) Tj
0 -15 Td
(4.5 Design releases the artwork to QA and to the buyer.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(4.6 The Buyer may create the purchase order only after the) Tj
0 -15 Td
(    Artwork Log shows the sign-off date.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
(5. Service standard) Tj
0 -15 Td
(Licensor sign-off is expected within 5 business days of submission.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(The Licensing Manager escalates to the licensor account manager on) Tj
0 -15 Td
(day 6. Packages returned by the licensor must be corrected and) Tj
0 -15 Td
(resubmitted within 2 business days.) Tj
ET
endstream
